{"type":"Film","id":"FR2014_025","slug":"fr2014-025-abus-de-faiblesse","title":{"native":"Abus de faiblesse","english":"Abuse of Weakness"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2014-02-12","year":2014},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Catherine Breillat","slug":"catherine-breillat","name":"Catherine Breillat","birthYear":1948,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2023-162-l-ete-dernier","title":{"native":"L'Été dernier"}},"year":2024,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"}]}],"genre":["Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/165/198/116389/format_page/abus-de-faiblesse.png","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AD37uyXWeV0"},"synopsis":{"native":"﻿Victime d’une hémorragie cérébrale, Maud, cinéaste, se réveille un matin dans un corps à moitié mort qui la laisse hémiplégique, face à une solitude inéluctable. Alitée mais déterminée à poursuivre son projet de film, elle découvre Vilko, arnaqueur de célébrités, en regardant un talk-show télévisé. Son arrogance crève l’écran avec superbe : Maud le veut pour son prochain film. Ils se rencontrent. Il ne la quitte plus. Elle aussi, il l’escroque et lui emprunte des sommes astronomiques. Il lui prend tout mais lui donne une gaieté et une sorte de chaleur familiale. Ce film raconte l’abus de faiblesse dont Maud est victime.","english":"A stroke victim, Maud, a filmmaker, comes to one morning in a body that is half-dead and which leaves her a hemiplegic confronted by ineluctable solitude. Although bedridden, she is determined to pursue a feature film project. One night, while watching a television talkshow, she discovers Vilko, a conman who has served time for ripping off celebrities. His arrogance leaps out of the screen: Maud wants him to be the lead in her next film. They meet. From then on, he's always by her side. He manipulates her, borrowing huge sums of money, stealing ev erything she's got, but giving her joy and a kind of cosy family nest in return. This film depicts the abuse of weakness of which Maud is a victim."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Belgium","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2014_025_01","film":"FR2014_025","person":{"id":"Isabelle Huppert","slug":"isabelle-huppert","name":"Isabelle Huppert","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2016-085-elle","title":{"native":"Elle"}},"year":2017,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Unknown","result":"Awarded"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2015-084-valley-of-love","title":{"native":"Valley of Love"}},"year":2016,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Unknown","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2016-085-elle","title":{"native":"Elle"}},"year":2016,"award":"European Film Awards","category":"Unknown","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2017-142-happy-end","title":{"native":"Happy End"}},"year":2017,"award":"European Film Awards","category":"Unknown","result":"Nominated"}]},"age":"3: Third Age (60-75)","gender":"Female identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Upper Middle class","profession":"Self-employed","ability":"Permanent disability","assistedMobility":"No"}],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Catherine Breillat","slug":"catherine-breillat","name":"Catherine Breillat","birthYear":1948,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2023-162-l-ete-dernier","title":{"native":"L'Été dernier"}},"year":2024,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"}]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Catherine Breillat","slug":"catherine-breillat","name":"Catherine Breillat","birthYear":1948,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2023-162-l-ete-dernier","title":{"native":"L'Été d